            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "the test covers \"don't overwrite statusline\", but where is the statusline in this screen assertion? \"hello\" is the cmdline message area, not the statusline, right?\n\nshould the test title be adjusted, or should we assert an actual statusline? (for predictability, `:set statusline=my-statusline`)\n\np.s. please confirm the test fails if the fix is reverted",
